OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSASwimmers urged to avoid beauty
OL,4,Aspot as drought and fires reveal
OL,5,A'hidden hazards'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"As the water has receded, previously
OL,8,Fhidden hazards and unknown objects have
OL,9,Fbeen exposed on the pond bed, creating
OL,10,Fserious safety risks. For your own
OL,11,Fsafety, you must not enter the water
OL,12,Funder any circumstances," the park
OL,13,Fauthority said in a Facebook post.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
